{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 0, "text": "// Player thinks"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 1, "text": "Кажется, одному тутъ не справиться."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 2, "text": "Надѣюсь, здѣшняя Мита не кусается..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 3, "text": "// Coffee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 4, "text": "На что я трачу время..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 5, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 8, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 9, "text": "// Player tries to wake up Mitu "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 10, "text": "Мита? // Try 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 11, "text": "Мита, проснись. // Try 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 12, "text": "Ми-ита. // Try 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 14, "text": "Мита, проснись!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 15, "text": "Мнѣ нужна твоя помощь."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 16, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 17, "text": "Ты кто-о?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 18, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 19, "text": "Помоги мнѣ съ рычагомъ."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 20, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 21, "text": "Какой еще рычагъ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 22, "text": "Дай поспать..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 23, "text": "Или сдѣлай мнѣ кофе."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 24, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 25, "text": "Тутъ пройти два шага..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 26, "text": "Мита?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 27, "text": "Ми-ита!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 28, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 31, "text": "// Player gives away the coffee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 32, "text": "Мита."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 33, "text": "Вотъ кофе."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 37, "text": "// MitaDream exercise"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 38, "text": "Такъ ты говоришь..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 39, "text": "Рычаги?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 40, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 41, "text": "Да."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 42, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 43, "text": "А откуда ты знаешь про нихъ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 44, "text": "Хотя чего я спрашиваю..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 45, "text": "Если ты тутъ,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 46, "text": "Значитъ, ты уже многое знаешь..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 48, "text": "Погоди,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 49, "text": "Нужно присѣсть."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 51, "text": "Такъ, и?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 52, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 53, "text": "Не знаю, что тебѣ сказать..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 54, "text": "Но мнѣ нужно пройти дальше."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 55, "text": "По маршруту, который строитъ кольцо..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 56, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 57, "text": "У тебя ​ея​ кольцо?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 58, "text": "Тогда понятно,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 59, "text": "Какъ ты сюда попалъ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 60, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 61, "text": "Вѣрно."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 62, "text": "Такъ ты мнѣ поможешь?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 63, "text": "Съ рычагами?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 64, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 65, "text": "Конечно. // Sle"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 66, "text": "Помогу... // Slee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 67, "text": "Съ рычагами... // Sleep"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 69, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 70, "text": "Мита, опять?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 71, "text": "Пойдемъ уже."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 72, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 73, "text": "А?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 74, "text": "Хорошо."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 75, "text": "Пошли."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 78, "text": "// fall mitadream - Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 79, "text": "Вставай."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 80, "text": "Тебѣ такъ сильно спать хочется?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 81, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 82, "text": "// again sleep mitadream - Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 83, "text": "Просни-ись."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 84, "text": "Мы вѣдь уже пришли."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 86, "text": "// Switches"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 87, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 88, "text": "Хорошо,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 89, "text": "Я готова."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 90, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 91, "text": "Я тоже готовъ."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 92, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 93, "text": "Ну..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 94, "text": "Я начну"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 95, "text": "Отсчетъ,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 96, "text": "И потомъ вмѣстѣ дернемъ рычаги."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 97, "text": "Хо-ро-шо? // slow sleep"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 98, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 99, "text": "Ты только не усни."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 100, "text": "Начинай отсчетъ."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 102, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 103, "text": "3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 104, "text": "2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 105, "text": "1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 106, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 107, "text": "// Player lose 1 - MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 108, "text": "Ты чего?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 109, "text": "Ну,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 110, "text": "Давай еще разъ."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 112, "text": "// Player lose 2 - MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 113, "text": "Опять?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 114, "text": "Еще чуть-чуть,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 115, "text": "И я"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 116, "text": "Усну..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 118, "text": "// Player lose 3 - MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 119, "text": "Сейчасъ усну..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 120, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 122, "text": "// Player Win"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 123, "text": "Отлично."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 124, "text": "Спасибо, Мита."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 125, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 126, "text": "Угумъ."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 128, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 129, "text": "Такіе..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 130, "text": "​Медленныя​..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 131, "text": "Двери..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 132, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 133, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 134, "text": "Я пошла спать..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 136, "text": "// Why kitchen? - MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 137, "text": "Зачѣмъ мы сюда пришли?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 138, "text": "Если я засну на холодномъ полу кухни,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 139, "text": "То виноватъ будешь ты."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 141, "text": "// Why bathroom? - MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 142, "text": "Не понимаю..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 143, "text": "И какіе же рычаги ты тутъ хотѣлъ подергать?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 144, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 145, "text": "// Put button - Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 146, "text": "Ничего не произошло?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 147, "text": "Зачѣмъ тогда здѣсь эта кнопка?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 149, "text": "// Cofee - Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 150, "text": "Можетъ, ты еще кофейка попьешь?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 151, "text": "Сейчасъ же снова уснешь."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 152, "text": "// MitaDream"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 153, "text": "Чего?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 154, "text": "Нееетъ."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 155, "text": "А вкусъ этого кофе ужасный..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 156, "text": "Я въ полномъ порядкѣ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 157, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 158, "text": "// Button - Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 159, "text": "Мита? Кнопка не работаетъ, слышишь?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 160, "text": "Ау? "}
